    27	 * Backend/AI -> CarSky KUKSA -> dms_hmi_bridge.lua -> VHAL PERF_VEHICLE_SPEED
    28	 * -> Android CarProperty -> this APK.
    29	 *
    30	 * Why multiplex?
    31	 * The CarSky AAOS image currently exposes PERF_VEHICLE_SPEED reliably, while
    32	 * custom DMS VHAL properties were not visible in Android CarService during
    33	 * runtime checks. The bridge therefore encodes DMS state into the standard
    34	 * speed property and this APK decodes it back into HMI state.
    35	 */
    36	public final class MainActivity extends Activity implements TextToSpeech.OnInitListener {
